#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/guide/install.md:1 docs/guide/install.md:5 messages/po4a/en.xml:618
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:9
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "> Deploy FreeAnima on your machine — npm CLI, Docker Compose, or from source.\n"
#| "> After install: [`security.md`](security.md) (credentials, bind address) · [`database.md`](database.md) (PostgreSQL) · [`service.md`](service.md) (runtime commands) · [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md) (Cloudflare Tunnel).\n"
msgid ""
"> Deploy FreeAnima on your machine — from source, or with a Linux standalone executable.\n"
"> After install: [`security.md`](security.md) (credentials, bind address) · [`database.md`](database.md) (PostgreSQL) · [`service.md`](service.md) (runtime commands) · [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md) (Service API Token / LAN).\n"
msgstr ""
"> 在本机部署逸灵风 — npm CLI、Docker Compose 或从源码安装。\n"
"> 安装后：[`security.md`](security.md)（凭证、绑定地址）· [`database.md`](database.md)（PostgreSQL）· [`service.md`](service.md)（运行时命令）。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/install.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a path"
msgstr "选择安装方式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:16
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Path               | Best for                                   | PostgreSQL  | Redis                  | Secrets                       |\n"
#| "| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ | ----------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n"
#| "| **npm CLI**        | Day-to-day self-hosting on your OS         | You install | Optional (recommended) | Vault / `env()` (recommended) |\n"
#| "| **Docker Compose** | Quick trial, minimal host setup            | Bundled     | Bundled                | `.env` env vars               |\n"
#| "| **Source**         | Contributors, bleeding-edge, custom builds | You install | Optional (recommended) | Vault / `env()` (recommended) |\n"
msgid ""
"| Path           | Best for                                  | Bun on host | PostgreSQL  | Redis                  | Secrets                       |\n"
"| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----------- | ----------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| **Source**     | Contributors, day-to-day development      | Required    | You install | Optional (recommended) | Vault / `env()` (recommended) |\n"
"| **Standalone** | Production / self-host without a checkout | Not needed  | You install | Optional (recommended) | Vault / `env()` (recommended) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 路径               | 适用场景                                   | PostgreSQL  | Redis                  | 密钥                          |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ | ----------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| **npm CLI**        | 日常在自有 OS 上自托管                     | 自行安装    | 可选（推荐）           | Vault / `env()`（推荐）       |\n"
"| **Docker Compose** | 快速试用、最少主机配置                     | 内置        | 内置                   | `.env` 环境变量               |\n"
"| **Source**         | 贡献者、前沿版本、自定义构建               | 自行安装    | 可选（推荐）           | Vault / `env()`（推荐）       |\n"

#
#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:18
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "All paths run the same `anima service` runtime (Habitat REST `/api` + Habitat RPC "
#| "`/rpc/v1` + engine). PostgreSQL with **pgvector** is **required**. "
#| "Redis powers EventBus and task context; it **degrades silently** when "
#| "unavailable — Docker and production setups should still run it."
msgid ""
"Both paths run the same `anima service` runtime (Habitat REST `/api` + Habitat RPC `/"
"hub/rpc/v1` + engine). PostgreSQL with **pgvector** is **required**. Redis "
"powers EventBus and task context; it **degrades silently** when unavailable "
"— production setups should still run it."
msgstr ""
"所有路径运行相同的 `anima service` 运行时（Habitat REST `/api` + SAP `/sap/v1` + "
"engine）。带 **pgvector** 的 PostgreSQL **必需**。Redis 支撑 EventBus 与任务"
"上下文，不可用时**静默降级** — Docker 与生产环境仍应运行 Redis。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/install.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shared prerequisites"
msgstr "共用前置条件"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:27
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Component      | Version / notes                                                                                                                       |\n"
#| "| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| **Bun**        | >= 1.3.14 — required for npm CLI and source installs ([bun.sh](https://bun.sh))                                                       |\n"
#| "| **PostgreSQL** | 17 recommended; extensions: `vector`, FTS helpers — see [`database.md`](database.md)                                                  |\n"
#| "| **Redis**      | 7.x recommended; defaults to `127.0.0.1:6379` when configured                                                                         |\n"
#| "| **Vault**      | Recommended for npm/source — API keys and DB URLs stay out of config files ([`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)) |\n"
msgid ""
"| Component      | Version / notes                                                                                                        |\n"
"| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Bun**        | >= 1.3.14 — required for **source** installs ([bun.sh](https://bun.sh)); not required for standalone binaries          |\n"
"| **PostgreSQL** | 17 recommended; extensions: `vector`, FTS helpers — see [`database.md`](database.md)                                   |\n"
"| **Redis**      | 7.x recommended; defaults to `127.0.0.1:6379` when configured                                                          |\n"
"| **Vault**      | Recommended — API keys and DB URLs stay out of config files ([`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 组件           | 版本 / 说明                                                                                                                           |\n"
"| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Bun**        | >= 1.3.14 — npm CLI 与源码安装必需（[bun.sh](https://bun.sh)）                                                                        |\n"
"| **PostgreSQL** | 推荐 17；扩展：`vector`、FTS 辅助 — 见 [`database.md`](database.md)                                                                   |\n"
"| **Redis**      | 推荐 7.x；配置后默认 `127.0.0.1:6379`                                                                                                 |\n"
"| **Vault**      | npm/源码推荐 — API 密钥与 DB URL 不写入配置文件（[`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)）                          |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:29
msgid ""
"Data directory: `~/.anima/` (override with `FREEANIMA_HOME`). Back it up "
"with your database."
msgstr ""
"数据目录：`~/.anima/`（可用 `FREEANIMA_HOME` 覆盖）。请与数据库一并备份。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/install.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Standalone (Linux x64)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:35
msgid ""
"Release publishes 三端产物（与 canary 对称）：`anima-linux-x64.tar.gz`、"
"`freeanima-desktop-windows-x64-setup.exe`、`freeanima-mobile-android.apk`"
"（CI 固定 upload 签名；本地 `debug:android` 仍为默认 debug 签名）。"
"Standalone tarball 内含单文件可执行文件 `anima`；版本、service build-meta、"
"migrations 与 Web UI 均嵌入该二进制。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/install.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Install (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | bash\n"
"anima --version   # e.g. 0.8.5 (standalone) · release\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:44
msgid "Canary（`main` 滚动 Pre-release tag `canary`）或 pin 版本："
