#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | CHANNEL=canary bash\n"
"curl -fsSL https://freeanima.com/install | VERSION=v0.8.5 bash\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:51
msgid ""
"国内网络可指定公共 GitHub 反代（`PROXY=none|ghproxy-net|gh-proxy-com|ghfast-"
