#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:196
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Dev** (Habitat + Vite HMR; never auto-builds Web). Prefer `just dev` for multi-worktree:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:197
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just dev            # Habitat random ≥10000 + Web from :5000; FREEANIMA_URL wires Vite proxy only\n"
"# or two terminals:\n"
"bun run dev:hub     # random ≥10000 (not production 2658); writes ~/.anima/dev-web.token\n"
"FREEANIMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:<hub-port> bun run dev:web   # default :5000; browser Habitat = page origin\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:205
msgid ""
"Browser Web defaults Habitat URL to the **page origin** (same in production Habitat-"
"hosted `/web` and Vite). Dev injects Service API Token from `dev-web.token` "
"automatically. If `http.tls.enabled` / `DEV_HTTPS=1`, Vite serves HTTPS "
"using `~/.anima/tls` (Habitat stays plain HTTP)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:207
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Source deploy** (Habitat hosts `/web/*` when `config.yaml` `web.enabled`): build Web first, then start — startup does not run `build:web`. Source-tree `anima` has no `service` command.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/install.md:208
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run build:web\n"
"bun run dev:hub\n"
"# UI: http://127.0.0.1:2658/web/chat\n"
msgstr ""

